You know how in Linley's Dungeon Crawl you get damage messages such as
"The giant newt is almost dead" or "The troll is lightly wounded" when
you hit monsters? Well, as part of my "stealing ideas from other RLs"
initiative this patch gives one of the character classes that
functionality.

DETAILS:

* Only for Healers! (They've studied Anatomy)
* You get the message whenever _you_ hit a monster with a weapon,
projectile, attack spell or ray.
* You can also check monsters for wounds using the ';' key.
* Hallucination obfuscation!

Note: this should _not_ make their stethoscopes useless. It only gives
you a vague phrase such as "The leocrotta is
(lightly/moderately/heavily) wounded" and doesn't reveal any numbers or
status effects and such.

